Based on your [Cybersecurity Dashboarding Notes](https://github.com/daya1an/aai-prep/blob/main/cyber-security/3-cybersecurity-dashboarding.md), here is the complete list of all abbreviations and acronyms found in the document:

* **CIEM:** Cloud Infrastructure Entitlement Management
* **CMDB:** Configuration Management Database
* **CISO:** Chief Information Security Officer
* **CSPM:** Cloud Security Posture Management
* **CVE:** Common Vulnerabilities and Exposures
* **CVSS:** Common Vulnerability Scoring System
* **DLP:** Data Loss Prevention
* **DPDP:** Digital Personal Data Protection
* **EDR:** Endpoint Detection and Response
* **GDPR:** General Data Protection Regulation
* **GRC:** Governance, Risk, and Compliance
* **IAM:** Identity and Access Management
* **IdP:** Identity Provider
* **IDS:** Intrusion Detection System
* **IPS:** Intrusion Prevention System
* **ISO:** International Organization for Standardization
* **ITSM:** Information Technology Service Management
* **KPI:** Key Performance Indicator
* **KRI:** Key Risk Indicator
* **MFA:** Multi-Factor Authentication
* **MTTC:** Mean Time to Contain
* **MTTD:** Mean Time to Detect
* **MTTR:** Mean Time to Respond / Resolve
* **NDR:** Network Detection and Response
* **PCI DSS:** Payment Card Industry Data Security Standard
* **PII:** Personally Identifiable Information
* **RCE:** Remote Code Execution
* **RAG:** Red, Amber, Green
* **SBOM:** Software Bill of Materials
* **SIEM:** Security Information and Event Management
* **SLA:** Service Level Agreement
* **SOAR:** Security Orchestration, Automation and Response
* **SOC:** Security Operations Center
* **UEBA:** User and Entity Behavior Analytics
* **VPC:** Virtual Private Cloud
* **WAF:** Web Application Firewall
* **XDR:** Extended Detection and Response
